<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pasminco could raise A$600 mln equity.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pasminco could raise A$600 mln equity.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zinc producer Pasminco Ltd said on Thursday it could raise up to A$600 million in equity to help fund the development of its huge Century Zinc project in northern Australia.</p>
</text>
